{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liuri wakes up, alone, deep inside a mine on an abandoned floating island. He doesn\u2019t know how he got there or why. There\u2019s only one thing to do: explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the timeless Sokoban genre, <strong>LABYBAN</strong> modernizes the puzzle game experience with an accessible, intuitive, and stimulating approach. Across more than <strong>140 levels</strong>, each puzzle pushes the gameplay mechanics even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleporters, slippery surfaces, conveyor belts... and many more surprises await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>LABYBAN</strong> is made up of seven distinct biomes, each with a strong visual identity and unique gameplay mechanics. Some introduce new ways to play, while others combine and transform previous challenges, ensuring a smooth and varied progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you manage to escape the island?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps in the maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541880/264c4fe545a66df7998e50b640273289206b9511.jpg"},{"name":"Cartographer.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541880/d0d0caaf6a78c927b55605c95483a6a24c7c0e35.jpg"},{"name":"End of the slide!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541880/d0f1cd239088aeee6b3807a5d60abb51feec042c.jpg"},{"name":"The key under the stone.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541880/e73d33466e677b6d09f2d666ffd296ecd9826a96.jpg"},{"name":"Frozen grip.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3541880/8c8332cdd4f49d33b83f8535aacbbf7d5f739e79.jpg"},{"name":"Woodland hook.","path